<title>SWITZERLAND: FIGURE SKATING-GERMANS WIN WORLD PAIRS TITLE.</title>
<headline>FIGURE SKATING-GERMANS WIN WORLD PAIRS TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>LAUSANNE, Switzerland 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germans Mandy Woetzel and Ingo Steuer won the gold medals in the pairs event at the world figure skating championships on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Defending champions Marina Eltsova and Andrei Bushkov of Russia won the silver medals and Russians Oksana Kazakova and Artur Dmitriev took bronze.</p>
</text>
